"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Batas laju, sambungan per torrent, slot unggahan, sarta seeding ditangtukeun pikeun unggal torrent nalika anjeun tambahkeunana, atawa saterusna di handapeun Pangaturan Torrent. Torrent ngagunakeun proksi ti tab Sambungan (HTTP atawa SOCKS5, atawa proksi Mac kalayan \"Paké pangaturan sistem\") sarta wates laju pikeun sadaya ngundeur. Parubahanna diterapkeun kana torrent anu dimimitian sanggeusna. Peer jeung trackers bisa ningali alamat IP anjeun, atawa proksi anjeun.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Pangaturan nu dipaké pikeun unggal-unggal ngundeur ti hiji situs. Sabuah situs ogé ngawengku subdomain-na (example.com ngawengku www.example.com). Log in ngan dikirim ka situs éta sarta disimpen jeung rahasia séjénna tina aplikasi.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Salinan cadangan ngandung pangaturan anjeun, pangaturan situs, ulikan, sarta daftar ngundeur. Sandi jeung kuki henteu pernah disimpen dina salinan cadangan.";
